SUMMARY:🎃 Free Movie Night: [REC] @ Innis Town Hall. With dinner
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎃 Fr
 ee Movie Night: [REC] — Just in Time for Halloween!\n\nGet ready to kick
  off the Halloween season with one of the most intense horror movies of th
 e 2000s! 👻\n\nJoin us Friday\, October 2 at Innis Town Hall for a FREE 
 screening of the 2007 Spanish horror classic [REC].\n\n📍 Innis Town Hal
 l\n2 Sussex Avenue\, Toronto\n🎬 Movie starts: 7:10 PM\n⏱️ Runtime: 
 78 minutes\n🇪🇸 Spanish with English subtitles\n\n🧟 About the Movi
 e\n\nA television reporter and her cameraman follow a group of firefighter
 s into an apartment building after receiving an emergency call. What start
 s as a routine assignment quickly turns into a terrifying nightmare when t
 he building is sealed off—and something inside begins attacking the resi
 dents.\n\nIf you like found-footage horror\, zombies\, claustrophobic thri
 llers and movies that make you yell at the screen\, this one is for you!\n
 \n🎥 Watch the trailer on YouTube:\n\n[https://youtu.be/oPvHTzqY2fM?si=a
 E6QjKvJ2Hlye0b8](https://youtu.be/oPvHTzqY2fM?si=aE6QjKvJ2Hlye0b8)\n\n👋
  Meet Nick\n\nMeet Nick in the lobby before the movie.\nI'll have a Meetup
  sign so you can easily find me.\n\n💰 FREE EVENT!\n\nThere are NO charg
 es or fees for this Meetup.\n\nPlease respect your RSVP—if you RSVP\, pl
 ease make every effort to attend.\n\nNot sure about your schedule yet? Tha
 t's okay! You can simply just show up if you're unsure whether you'll be a
 ble to make it. No pressure to RSVP.\n\nCome out\, meet some fellow movie 
 fans\, and get your Halloween season started with 78 minutes of pure terro
 r! 🎃👻📽️[REC] is 78 minutes long according to IMDb and Rotten To
 matoes. Innis Town Hall is at 2 Sussex Avenue and is used for free film sc
 reenings.\n\nFor anyone who wants to keep the evening going\, we'll walk a
 bout 10 minutes over to the Duke of York for food\, drinks\, and conversat
 ion. There we'll meet up with Mathew and the ghost walk attendees.
