SUMMARY:🌙🍂 Fall Evening Walk: High Park & Ghost Stories 👻
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🌙
 🍂 **Fall Evening Walk: High Park & Ghost Stories** 👻\n\n### Fall Col
 ours\, Spooky Stories & A Different Way to Spend Your Evening\n\nLooking f
 or something a little different to do after work?\n\nJoin us for an **even
 ing walk through High Park**\, where we'll enjoy the fall colours while st
 opping along the way for some of the park's stranger\, spookier\, and down
 right weird stories.\nHigh Park has a long history of ghost stories and lo
 cal legends.\n\nFrom stories connected to the **War of 1812** — yes\, *t
 hat* War of 1812 — to tales of mysterious deaths and people who may not 
 have completely left the park behind\, there's plenty of history to make a
 n ordinary fall walk a little more interesting.\nBut don't worry.\n\n**Thi
 s isn't a terrifying ghost hunt.** 👻\n\nThink **fall colours\, creepy s
 tories\, a little history\, a few laughs\, and just enough spooky atmosphe
 re to make you look over your shoulder once or twice.**\n\nIt's a relaxed 
 way to get outside after work\, explore one of Toronto's most beautiful pa
 rks\, and experience High Park as the daylight starts to disappear. 🍂
 🌙\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](ht
 tps://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 👻 What W
 e'll Do\n\nWe'll walk through **High Park**\, stopping at different locati
 ons along the way while I share stories connected to the park's history an
 d ghostly legends.\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n* Explore some of High Park's 
 most interesting locations\n* Hear stories of ghosts\, legends\, and stran
 ge events 👻\n* Learn a little about the park's history\n* Take photos a
 nd enjoy the scenery 📸\n* Have some Halloween fun along the way 🎃\n\
 nWe'll keep a steady walking pace\, with regular stops for storytelling.\n
 The walk will remain **outside throughout** — there is no entry into bui
 ldings.\n\n***\n\n## 🎃 Halloween Day — So Let's Have Some Fun\n\nThis
  isn't meant to be a serious paranormal investigation.\n\nSome stories are
  creepy. Some are strange. Some might make you wonder whether there's actu
 ally something going on.\nAnd some are just a good excuse to tell a spooky
  story while walking through the fall leaves.\n\n**You don't have to belie
 ve in ghosts.**\nYou just have to enjoy a good story.\n\n***\n\n## 🍁 Fa
 ll Weather & Expectations\n\nThis is an outdoor walk\, so please dress app
 ropriately for the weather.\nHigh Park can be cool and damp in late Octobe
 r\, so bring a warm jacket and wear comfortable walking shoes.\nWe'll be w
 alking at a steady pace\, with stops along the way for stories and photos.
 \n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** High Park s
 ign on the west side at Bloor Street West & High Park Avenue\n🫎 **Look 
 for me in my Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **6:30pm sharp**\nI will o
 nly wait **5 minutes.**\n**Early is on time. On time is late.**\n🚶 **Pa
 ce:** Steady walking pace\n🏁 **End Point:** Back where we started\n\n**
 *\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$10 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 *
 *mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\nThis is a **curated\, guided storytelling ex
 perience**\, rather than one of our regular group walks. The route\, stori
 es\, and history have been researched and developed specifically for this 
 experience.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortabl
 e walking shoes\n🧥 Warm fall jacket or layers\n📸 Camera or phone\n
 🎃 Halloween spirit\nAnd if you want to wear a costume...\n**I'm certain
 ly not going to stop you.** 👻\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThi
 s is great for:\n\n* People who love Halloween 🎃\n* Anyone who enjoys g
 host stories\n* Fall-colour enthusiasts 🍂\n* History buffs\n* People lo
 oking for something different to do on Halloween Day\n* Anyone who enjoys 
 a good story and a few laughs\n* People who want to meet new people while 
 exploring Toronto\n\nYou're welcome to RSVP ahead of time or just show up 
 on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things happen 
 and events may need to be cancelled or changed\, so please keep an eye on 
 the event page for updates.\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\nQuestions? Post
  on the event wall or email **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**C
 ome for the fall colours.** 🍂\n**Stay for the ghost stories.** 👻\n**
 Leave with a new connection — if the ghosts don't get you first.** 🎃
